# Top-level Wolfi packages for Dockerfile.chainguard, grouped by the Dockerfile step that installs them.
# After editing this file, or to pick up newer package builds, regenerate the full pinned closure in apk-packages.lock:
#
#   scaleset/runner/update-apk-lock.sh
#
# Format: <step> <package> [<package> ...]
#   build   build stage (downloads the runner, container hooks, and docker CLI)
#   system  final stage, before the runner user is created
#   tools   final stage, "OS Software Customizations" toolchain
build   curl unzip
system  sudo lsb-release-minimal gpg-agent bash gnutar
tools   git make wget gnupg tree curl unzip zip gzip zstd jq skopeo htop psmisc openssh-client py3-ansible-runner
